# AI Newsletter digest pipeline.
#
#   releases ─┐
#             ├─> summarizer ─> digest ─> log
#   community ┘
#
# Two independent sources fan into one summarizer (fan-in is free — both just
# point their sink at `summarizer`). The summarizer is source-agnostic; the
# digest accumulates and, on `flush`, writes one markdown draft. `log` reuses
# the substrate's Log primitive. Adding a third source = one more make_node +
# one connect_node line; nothing downstream changes.
make_node Releases_Source   releases
make_node Community_Source  community
make_node Summarizer        summarizer
make_node Digest_Builder    digest
make_node Tee               tee
make_node Log               log /tmp/newspack-ai-newsletter/digest.md append 1 7
connect_node releases   summarizer
connect_node community  summarizer
connect_node summarizer digest
connect_node digest     tee
connect_node tee        log
connect_node tee        _repl
